  (219, 'Gravity Volley', 'Spell_Nature_Cyclone', 'Pulls every normal enemy within 12 yards of the largest group into the middle, then rains arrows on them for 3 sec, dealing damage, 5% more for each different debuff on the target. Elites and bosses resist the pull. Every 25 enemies it hits loads an Explosive Arrow into your Aimed Shot, up to 2.', 22908, 3, 6000, 20, 8, 0.4, 4, 0, 0, 137, 0, 3000, 0, 27, 1.5, 1000, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 67108864, 0, 0, 255, 5, 0),
  (220, 'Flare', 'Spell_Fire_Flare', 'Marks every enemy within 10 yards of the largest group for 8 sec. Marked enemies take 15% more damage. For 6 sec, your shots that hit an enemy there fire 1 additional shot at another enemy there.', 1543, 3, 6000, 20, 10, 0, 4, 0, 0, 205, 0, 8000, 0, 28, 6000, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 67108864, 9, 1, 0, 0, 0),
